  "title": "The Rescue",
  "intro": {
    "summary": "Servants of the Frozen Horror have seized Gothar, the Great Elder of the Barbarian tribe, and carried him to a Dread stronghold near Ice Mountain. He is wise but old and frail, and he will not last long in the hands of Dread's creatures. This final solo test is to enter the stronghold, find Gothar and bring him out alive. The Barbarian begins on the spiral stairway and must return to it to end the quest."
